---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Pehiāweri B1B Ahu Whenua Trust"
  description="Privacy policy for the Pehiāweri B1B Hui System."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-cream-dark bg-white px-6 py-8 shadow-sm sm:px-10">
    <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl font-semibold text-forest">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-forest/70">Effective 1 October 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-forest/90">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The Hui System is operated by Pehiāweri B1B Ahu Whenua Trust to manage hui information
          and meeting documents for the trust.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">Information we process</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">The system may process:</p>
        <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>A trustee’s name, email address, and sign-in identifier for authentication and access control.</li>
          <li>Hui details entered by authorized trustees, including dates, locations, descriptions, and links.</li>
          <li>Meeting documents uploaded by authorized trustees, including file names, file content, type, size, and upload metadata.</li>
          <li>Limited technical and security logs needed to operate, troubleshoot, and protect the service.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">How we use Google data</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The system uses the Google Drive <code>drive.file</code> permission to create and manage
          only the Drive files and folders created for this application. It does not request access
          to every file in the connected Google Drive account.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Google account and Drive data is used only to authenticate approved trustees and provide
          the meeting-document features requested by the trust. It is not used for advertising or
          sold to third parties.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          The use and transfer of information received from Google APIs complies with the
          <a
            class="underline hover:text-gold-dark"
            href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including its Limited Use requirements.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">Storage and sharing</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Private meeting minutes and notes are stored in the trust’s connected Google Drive and
          are delivered through authenticated application routes. Trustee identity and hui data is
          processed using Supabase, and the application is hosted through Cloudflare. These
          providers process information only to supply their respective services.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          Information is shared outside the trust only when required by law, necessary to protect
          the service or its users, or directed by an authorized trust representative.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">Retention and deletion</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Information is retained while needed for trust administration, record keeping, security,
          or legal obligations. Authorized trustees can remove hui records through the portal.
          Drive access can be revoked from the connected Google Account’s third-party connections
          page. Revoking access stops future application access but does not automatically delete
          files already stored in Drive.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">Security</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Administrative features require an approved trustee account. Google Drive credentials
          are kept on the server and are not exposed to trustees’ browsers. No internet service can
          guarantee absolute security, but reasonable controls are used to restrict access and
          protect stored information.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          For privacy questions, access requests, or deletion requests, contact
          <a class="underline hover:text-gold-dark" href="mailto:pehiawerib1b@gmail.com">
            pehiawerib1b@gmail.com
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-forest">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This policy may be updated when the service or its legal obligations change. The effective
          date above will be updated when material changes are published.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
